WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.658
Chomp! Chomp! Chomp!

2
00:00:03.659 --> 00:00:06.353
The robot shark shot toward Roxy.

3
00:00:06.354 --> 00:00:09.126
"Whoa!" Roxy darted to the side.

4
00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:12.445
The shark's snapping jaws just missed her.

5
00:00:12.446 --> 00:00:14.669
People on the street below pointed.

6
00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:18.244
"A flying robot shark!" a man cried.

7
00:00:18.245 --> 00:00:21.160
"Run!" a woman shouted.

8
00:00:21.161 --> 00:00:25.948
The shark flew at Roxy again. Its jaws were wide open.

9
00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:30.205
Whoosh! Roxy blew her freeze breath at the shark.

10
00:00:30.206 --> 00:00:33.176
Its jaws froze in place.

11
00:00:33.177 --> 00:00:37.257
Roxy grabbed the shark and swung it toward the ground.

12
00:00:37.258 --> 00:00:40.260
It smashed into a million pieces.

13
00:00:40.261 --> 00:00:43.334
"Now I need to catch Bonnie Bones!"

14
00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:44.882
Zoom!

15
00:00:44.883 --> 00:00:48.817
She spotted the pirate ship flying over Metro City Park.

16
00:00:48.818 --> 00:00:51.207
Roxy landed on the ship's deck.

17
00:00:51.223 --> 00:00:53.512
Bonnie Bones stood at the wheel.

18
00:00:53.513 --> 00:00:55.958
A big cannon sat near her.

19
00:00:55.959 --> 00:00:59.869
"Land this ship right now!" Roxy shouted.

20
00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.350
"I'm taking you to jail!"

21
00:01:02.351 --> 00:01:04.535
"Jail!" the parrot sang.

22
00:01:04.536 --> 00:01:10.901
"Arr!" Bonnie Bones pointed the cannon at Roxy and lit the fuse.

23
00:01:10.902 --> 00:01:13.741
Boom! A cannonball shot out.

24
00:01:13.742 --> 00:01:16.507
Roxy leaped forward and caught the cannonball.

25
00:01:16.508 --> 00:01:21.355
Bonnie's eyes went wide. "How did you . . . ?"

26
00:01:21.356 --> 00:01:23.853
Roxy rolled the cannonball back at Bonnie.

27
00:01:23.854 --> 00:01:26.897
The pirate jumped out of the way.

28
00:01:26.898 --> 00:01:29.341
Then she lit the fuse again.

29
00:01:29.342 --> 00:01:30.990
Roxy stared hard.

30
00:01:30.991 --> 00:01:36.421
Orange beams shot from her eyes and melted the cannon.

31
00:01:36.422 --> 00:01:39.367
"Arr!" Bonnie tried to run away. Whiz-hoo!

32
00:01:39.368 --> 00:01:43.912
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Bonnie

33
00:01:43.913 --> 00:01:46.934
blocked the laser beams with her hook. The

34
00:01:46.935 --> 00:01:56.310
beams bounced off and hit the ship's wheel. Ka-boom! "Ahh!"

35
00:01:56.311 --> 00:02:03.696
Bonnie held onto a railing as the ship crash-landed in the park. The

36
00:02:03.697 --> 00:02:05.848
ship's hull broke open. Money

37
00:02:05.849 --> 00:02:11.780
from the pirates' bank robberies spilled out. Jack

38
00:02:11.781 --> 00:02:15.024
gasped. "Pirate treasure!" Mara

39
00:02:15.025 --> 00:02:21.483
pointed at the ship's deck. "Rocket Girl!" Roxy

40
00:02:21.484 --> 00:02:24.016
stood in front of Bonnie. The

41
00:02:24.017 --> 00:02:26.569
pirate looked over her shoulder. She

42
00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:28.798
was standing on the ship's plank. It

43
00:02:28.799 --> 00:02:30.663
was a long way down. Police

44
00:02:30.664 --> 00:02:33.237
officers waited below. "You

45
00:02:33.238 --> 00:02:36.855
have two choices," Roxy said. "Go

46
00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:42.112
to jail now—or after you walk the plank!" "Walk

47
00:02:42.113 --> 00:02:44.954
the plank!" the parrot sang. Bonnie

48
00:02:44.955 --> 00:02:46.954
Bones hung her head. "Arr.

49
00:02:46.955 --> 00:02:52.968
I guess we're going to jail." ***

50
00:02:52.969 --> 00:02:56.148
Later Roxy found her friends in the park.

51
00:02:56.149 --> 00:02:58.866
"Where were you?" Mara asked.

52
00:02:58.867 --> 00:03:01.927
"You missed all the excitement!"

53
00:03:01.928 --> 00:03:06.382
"Really?" Roxy asked. "Did you find the box?"

54
00:03:06.383 --> 00:03:11.285
"We saw something better," Jack said. "Pirate's treasure!"

55
00:03:11.286 --> 00:03:12.473
Terrell nodded.

56
00:03:12.474 --> 00:03:17.199
"Rocket Girl found it. But you probably knew that, right?"

57
00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:22.144
"Huh?" Jack said. "How would Roxy know that?"

58
00:03:22.145 --> 00:03:28.505
Just then Roxy spotted something under a shrub. "The box!"

59
00:03:28.506 --> 00:03:31.689
They ran over to see what was inside.

60
00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:34.043
"Whew," Roxy thought.

61
00:03:34.044 --> 00:03:37.599
"My secret is still safe."

